            "notes": "The strategy of this deck revolves around utilizing Karlov of the Ghost Council's ability to gain counters whenever you gain life. The deck is focused on aggressive plays and maintaining control over the board by using various lifegain effects to pump up Karlov and deal damage to opponents. The deck includes a mix of low-cost creatures with lifelink and protection abilities, removal spells like Swords to Plowshares and Fatal Push, as well as cards like Solitude and Vindicate to deal with threats. Additionally, there are cards like Sorin, Vengeful Bloodlord and Parallax Wave to provide additional utility and help secure the win by overwhelming opponents with relentless pressure and efficient removal."
